(window.AUDP=window.AUDP||{})["c"]={"af_heart|Hi, I'm calling about the printer I ordered last week. It was supposed to arrive on Monday, but I still haven't received it.":"","am_michael|I'm sorry about that. Can I have your order number, please?":"","af_heart|Sure, it's four, five, seven, two.":"","am_michael|Thank you. It looks like the shipment was delayed because of bad weather. It should arrive tomorrow morning. I'll also give you free shipping on your next order.":"","am_michael|Linh, are you going to the training session on the new accounting software this afternoon?":"","af_heart|I'd like to, but I have to finish the budget report for the director by four.":"","am_michael|Don't worry. The session will be recorded, so you can watch it later.":"","af_heart|Great. Could you send me the link when it's available?":"","af_heart|Hi, Tom. I'd like to book the large conference room for Thursday morning. We have some visitors from our Tokyo office.":"","am_michael|Unfortunately, it's already reserved for a board meeting that day. The small room on the third floor is free, though.":"","af_heart|How many people can it hold? There will be twelve of us.":"","am_michael|Only eight, I'm afraid. But the large room is available on Friday, if you can change the date.":"","am_michael|Good evening, Lotus Restaurant. How can I help you?":"","af_heart|Hi, I booked a table for six people tomorrow at seven, under the name Nguyen. I'd like to change it to eight people if possible.":"","am_michael|Let me check. We don't have a table for eight at seven, but there's one available at eight thirty.":"","af_heart|That's a bit late, but okay. Please change it to eight thirty.":"","af_heart|Kevin, the projector in meeting room A isn't working again. I have a client presentation in thirty minutes.":"","am_michael|I'll call the IT department, but they're usually busy in the morning. Why don't you use meeting room C? The equipment there was replaced last week.":"","af_heart|Good idea. Could you help me carry my laptop and these brochures?":"","am_michael|Sure, I'll be right there.":"","af_heart|Have you two heard that our department is moving to the fifth floor next month?":"","am_michael|Yes, I saw the memo. I'm glad, because the new space has more natural light.":"","bm_george|But we'll need to pack everything ourselves. Do you know if the company is providing boxes?":"","af_heart|The facilities team is delivering boxes on Monday. They also said movers will handle the furniture.":"","am_michael|Great. I'll start labeling my files this week, then.":"","am_michael|Hello, this is Bao from Golden Spoon Catering. I'm calling to confirm your order for the company lunch on Friday.":"","af_heart|Thanks for calling. Actually, we'll have about ten more people than we expected, so forty in total.":"","am_michael|No problem. Would you like to add more vegetarian dishes as well?":"","af_heart|Yes, please. And could you deliver at eleven thirty instead of noon?":"","am_michael|Hi, I'd like to rent a truck this Saturday. I'm moving out of a two-bedroom apartment.":"","af_heart|For two bedrooms, most customers choose our large truck. Unfortunately, all of our large trucks are booked on Saturday.":"","am_michael|Hmm, I don't think the medium one will be big enough. Since the large ones are gone, I'll take the next size up.":"","af_heart|OK. Please remember to bring your driver's license when you pick it up.":"","af_heart|Raj, the client from Osaka wants the product samples by Thursday instead of next week.":"","am_michael|Thursday? The factory just told me they can't finish the samples until Friday.":"","af_heart|We can't lose this client. Do you think we could pay the factory for overtime?":"","am_michael|Well, the budget for this project is already pretty tight.":"","af_heart|I'll talk to the director this afternoon and see what she thinks.":"","af_heart|Excuse me, I was going to take the 9:40 train to Hai Phong, but I see it's delayed.":"","am_michael|Yes, there's a signal problem. It may be delayed by more than two hours.":"","af_heart|Oh no, I have a meeting there at one o'clock. The trip takes about two hours, right?":"","am_michael|That's right. I'd recommend the next train. It's on time, and you'll still make your meeting.":"","am_michael|Thu, the quarterly figures just came in. Can you stay late to help me finish the presentation for tomorrow?":"","af_heart|I've got a dentist appointment at four.":"","am_michael|Oh, right. Then maybe Khoa can help. He's familiar with the sales data.":"","af_heart|Good idea. I can send you my notes on the regional results before I leave.":"","af_heart|Attention, passengers on Flight two-oh-eight to Singapore. Due to a technical problem, departure has been delayed by approximately one hour. The new departure time is three forty-five P.M. Passengers can pick up a meal voucher at the information desk next to Gate twelve. We apologize for the inconvenience.":"","am_michael|Hello, this is Mark from Green Valley Dental Clinic calling for Ms. Hoa. I'm calling to remind you of your appointment tomorrow at ten A.M. Please arrive fifteen minutes early to fill out some forms. If you need to reschedule, call us at five five five, oh one nine eight before five P.M. today.":"","af_heart|Welcome to Sunrise Foods. My name is Anna, and I'll be your guide today. We'll begin with the packaging area, where our products are prepared for shipping. For safety reasons, please wear the hairnets and gloves you received at the entrance. Photos are not allowed inside the factory. At the end of the tour, you'll be able to taste some of our new snacks in the visitor center.":"","af_heart|Good morning, this is Lan Chi with your traffic update on City Radio. Drivers heading downtown should expect delays on Nguyen Trai Street because of road construction near the Royal City intersection. Workers are replacing a water pipe, and two lanes will remain closed until Friday. If possible, use Le Van Luong Street instead. Also, the city has added extra buses on Route thirty-two this week to help commuters. Stay tuned for the weather report after this short break.":"","am_michael|Before we finish, I'd like to share some good news. Our customer satisfaction scores rose by twelve percent last quarter, mainly because of the new online chat service. To keep improving, we'll be hiring four more support agents next month. I'd also like each team leader to send me a list of training topics by Wednesday. We'll use your suggestions to plan next month's workshop.":"","am_michael|Welcome to the Museum of Vietnamese History. I'm Huy, and I'll be guiding you through the main exhibits today. Our tour will last about ninety minutes. We'll start in the Bronze Age gallery, then continue to the ceramics collection on the second floor. Please note that flash photography is not permitted, as it can damage the artifacts. At the end of the tour, you're welcome to visit our gift shop, where visitors with today's ticket receive ten percent off.":"","af_heart|Is your old phone running slowly? Bring it to TechFix, the city's fastest repair service. Our certified technicians can replace screens and batteries in under an hour, and every repair comes with a six-month warranty. This month only, students receive fifteen percent off all services. Visit any of our five locations or book an appointment on our Web site.":"","af_heart|Attention, shoppers. Today only, all winter jackets on the second floor are forty percent off. In addition, customers who spend over two million dong will receive a free reusable shopping bag at checkout. Please note that the store will close early today, at six P.M., for inventory. Thank you for shopping at Saigon Mall.":"","am_michael|Good morning, everyone, and welcome to your first day at Vina Logistics. My name is Thanh, and I work in Human Resources. In a moment, we'll head upstairs to my department, where you'll fill out your tax forms and receive your ID badges. After lunch, you'll meet your team leaders in the conference room one floor above my department. Please keep your badges with you at all times, as you'll need them to enter the building.":"","am_michael|Hi, Ms. Hanh, this is Peter from Star Events. I'm calling about the banquet room you reserved for the twentieth. Unfortunately, the air-conditioning system in that room needs urgent repair, and the work won't be finished in time. We do have a larger hall available on the same date at no extra charge. I know it's short notice, but please call me back by tomorrow so we can update your booking.":"","af_heart|Thank you all for coming to this year's Logistics Innovation Forum. As you can see, the main hall is completely full. In fact, we had to open the overflow room next door, where the talks are being shown on a large screen. Our first speaker, Dr. Minh, will discuss how small warehouses can use automation. Afterward, please take a moment to fill out the feedback card on your seat; we'll use your comments to choose next year's topics.":""};